### Place an order (happy path) — note pricingEngineVersion in the response
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "PRACTICE-2001",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "DEN-GLV-001", "quantity": 12 },
    { "sku": "DEN-PRV-002", "quantity": 30 }
  ]
}

### Force pricing v2 via header (mesh lab 06 — header must be propagated by order-service)
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-pricing-version: v2

{
  "customerId": "PRACTICE-2001",
  "items": [ { "sku": "DEN-DSP-001", "quantity": 55 } ]
}

### Out of stock → 409 with shortages
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "PRACTICE-2001",
  "items": [ { "sku": "DEN-IMP-002", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Inactive product → 422
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "PRACTICE-2001",
  "items": [ { "sku": "DEN-END-001", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Order history for a practice (seeded)
GET {{order}}/api/orders?customerId=PRACTICE-1002

### Single seeded order
GET {{order}}/api/orders/7b1e9c2a-0d1f-4c55-9a51-2f0c6a1d0001
